// `tabularGridMode` on the same source in both modes, and in every export besides HTML.
//
// `source` (the default) renders the grid the LaTeX declares: a row whose every column a span covers
// has no cells of its own and comes out as `<tr></tr>`, and a cell written into a covered column is
